{"ref":"BDB, שִׂיחַ²","hw":"שִׂיחַ²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחַ</span></big>  <strong>vb.denom. muse, complain</strong>, poet. <strong>talk</strong> (of);—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשִׂיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:23\" href=\"/Psalms.119.23\">ψ 119:23</a>; 3 fs. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשִׂיחֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.22\">Pr 6:22</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָשִׂיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:78\" href=\"/Psalms.119.78\">ψ 119:78</a> +, etc.; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 12:8\" href=\"/Job.12.8\">Jb 12:8</a>; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:10\" href=\"/Judges.5.10\">Ju 5:10</a> +; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:148\" href=\"/Psalms.119.148\">ψ 119:148</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>complain:</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:18\" href=\"/Psalms.55.18\">ψ 55:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:4\" href=\"/Psalms.77.4\">77:4</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הָמָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 7:11\" href=\"/Job.7.11\">Jb 7:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בְּמַר נַפְשִׁי)</span>, + <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:7\" href=\"/Psalms.6.7\">ψ 6:7</a> (read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָשִׂיחָה</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">אַשְׂחֶה</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>muse:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם־לְבָבִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:7\" href=\"/Psalms.77.7\">ψ 77:7</a>; c. ב, <em>meditate upon, study</em>, God’s <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲלִילוֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:13\" href=\"/Psalms.77.13\">13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הָגָה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּקּוּדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:15\" href=\"/Psalms.119.15\">119:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:78\" href=\"/Psalms.119.78\">78</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻקִּים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:23\" href=\"/Psalms.119.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:48\" href=\"/Psalms.119.48\">48</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִפְלָאוֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:27\" href=\"/Psalms.119.27\">27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִמְרָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:148\" href=\"/Psalms.119.148\">148</a>; c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבְרֵי נִפְלְאֹתֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:5\" href=\"/Psalms.145.5\">145:5</a>. <strong>3.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>talk</em> (about), <em>sing</em> (of): abs. <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:10\" href=\"/Judges.5.10\">Ju 5:10</a> (ode); c. ב rei, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:2\" href=\"/Psalms.105.2\">ψ 105:2</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.9\">1 Ch 16:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁיר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמֵּר</span>; so SS Gerber, but poss. = <strong>2</strong>, so Dr), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:13\" href=\"/Psalms.69.13\">ψ 69:13</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ב</span> pers. <em>against;</em> ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נְגִינוֹת</span>, of mocking words). <strong>b.</strong>  c. sf. pers. <em>talk</em> (with) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.22\">Pr 6:22</a> (del. Toy); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <em>speak to</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 12:8\" href=\"/Job.12.8\">Jb 12:8</a> (Di ‘<em>sprich sinnend</em>’<em>;</em> Hi Bu read <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁרֶץ</span>; Kau <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיַּת</span> (so Bu as altern.), Bö al. sub II. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחַ</span>). <strong>Pôlʿel</strong> <em>meditate, consider:</em> Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְשׂוֹחֵחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.8\">Is 53:8</a> (abs.); 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשׂוֹחֵחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:5\" href=\"/Psalms.143.5\">ψ 143:5</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ב</span> rei; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הָגָה</span>).","next":"BDB, שֵׂחַ²","prev":"BDB, שִׂיחָה"}